  <description>NXP FRDM-MCXN236 (Cortex-M33) development board. Arduino-compatible sockets J1-J4 (D0-D13, D18/D19, A0-A5, power), PWM0-PWM5 on the inner column of J3 and the mikroBUS sockets J5/J6. Pin names follow the mcx-arduino-core board package.</description>
